- **Per-leaf walk-forward CAGR**: inside the existing WF loop, added `model_wf.apply(X_yr)` to assign `leaf_id_wf` to each scored stock; collected `{leaf_id, year, n, avg_ret, avg_prob, excess}` rows per year
