### `build_portfolio.py` — IC-Weighted Kelly Portfolio Constructor

```bash
python3 scripts/build_portfolio.py                                      # Default: long_only, horizon=1y, all markets
python3 scripts/build_portfolio.py --strategy long_short --horizon 3y
