    "---\n",
    "## 9. High-Conviction Leveraged Portfolio\n",
    "> **Margin-of-safety filter + Kelly leverage.**\n",
    "> Starts from the top COMPOSITE percentile, applies 4 hard safety gates\n",
    "> (Piotroski \u2265 7, Altman Z > 1.81, FCF yield > 0, Beneish < \u22121.78), then\n",
    "> assigns a leverage multiplier (1\u00d7\u20132\u00d7) based on safety tier \u00d7 beta.\n",
    "> Only Tier-1 names (all 4 gates pass) with low beta get the full 2\u00d7 lever.\n",
    ">\n",
    "> **Tier legend** \u2014 \ud83d\udfe2 Tier 1 (4/4 gates) \u00b7 \ud83d\udfe1 Tier 2 (3/4) \u00b7 \ud83d\udd34 Tier 3 (2/4)\n"
   ]
